  description="Annual boiler service on the Wirral for £95 inc VAT. Service + CP12 £195. Gas Safe registered engineers, CH41 to CH64, Benchmark record emailed the same day. No call-out fee. Call 0151 558 0334."
  h1="Boiler Service Wirral"
  badge="Gas Safe registered · CH41 to CH64"
  intro="An annual boiler service on the Wirral for £95 including VAT, with no call-out fee. Our Gas Safe registered engineers clean and test your boiler in about an hour. We cover every CH postcode, from Birkenhead terraces to Heswall system boilers."
  stats={[['£95', 'Boiler service, inc VAT'], ['45–60 min', 'Most services']]}
